entry.content:
coach_board: description  -whiteboard; +whiteboard, and with an answer whose key points or picture help the person follow what the coach says;
coach_listen: description  -stop speaking +pause at the end of a thought -Answer through +When it hears them: at once, in the same step, call -reply_to +a short acknowledgment that says what you are about to do (reply_to +with a head nod cue) and call the GoldSeam service the request needs; when the service answers, call coach_say with the answer and coach_board with its key points or a picture when they help;
coach_say: description  -coach, with captions, +coach +Words sent while the coach is still speaking wait their turn, so a short acknowledgment can go first and the answer after it. The coach view shows the words beside the coach as it speaks them: do not repeat them in the chat; while the view is showing the coach, your chat reply is one short line naming what you looked up.
open_coach: description, inputSchema  -a floating (pip) mode +fullscreen -one +it  parameters: -pip (floating) +fullscreen
